# The api host's own routes (core/apps/api/README.md "Health"): public, no session, no body.

### GET /health: runs the registered checks; 200 with the checks and the version, 503 naming the failing ones
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### GET /health/live: 200 while the process answers, without running a check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
Accept: application/json
